        '3-5', $q$A Fish Tank for Room 12$q$, $q$(1) Our classroom should get a fish tank. (2) A fish tank would help us learn about science. (3) We could watch the fish eat, swim and grow every day. (4) We could also write down what we see in a science journal.

(5) Taking care of fish would teach us to be responsible. (6) Each week, two students could feed the fish and check the water. (7) My cousin has a pet hamster named Biscuit.

