        '3-5', $q$Our Town Needs a Bike Path$q$, $q$(1) Many kids in Pine Hollow ride bikes to the park on weekends. (2) Our town should build a bike path along River Road. (3) Right now, bikes have to share the road with cars and trucks. (4) A bike path would keep riders safer because they would have their own space.

(5) A bike path would also help people stay healthy. (6) For example, my neighbor Mrs. Ortiz says she would ride to work every day if there were a safe path. (7) Riding a bike is good exercise for the heart and legs.

(8) Bikes are also better for the air than cars. (9) Fewer cars on the road would mean less smoke and noise. (10) Some bikes have baskets for carrying things.

(11) For all these reasons, Pine Hollow should build a bike path so everyone can ride safely.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
