  ('4525f4b2-19e9-5949-b163-d5410ea45923', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-opinion-writing'), null, 'hard',
   $q$Which sentence would be the best concluding statement for this piece?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In conclusion, the zoo is an hour away, and the bus ride there would take a long time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"conclusion-too-narrow"},{"text":"Trains are my favorite way to travel, and I hope to ride a real one very soon.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"new-claim-not-restating"},{"text":"The museum teaches our history, lets us try things and is close by, so it is the best trip for us.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The museum also has a small park with picnic tables and a fountain outside.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"detail-not-conclusion"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The museum teaches our history, lets us try things and is close by, so it is the best trip for us.$q$, $q$The best conclusion restates the opinion and sums up all three reasons: history, hands-on fun and a short ride. The zoo sentence begins with "In conclusion," but it only repeats one small detail and never restates the opinion.$q$, 'draft', '18e5d98e-9a06-5cc0-895c-f56cf99bbb74')
