insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('418321a5-fe50-5dc8-b2da-f28a8b29d1fc', 'wg3-opinion-writing-p05', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Start a Chess Club$q$, $q$(1) Some games are just for fun, but chess can teach important skills. (2) Our school should start a chess club.

(3) Chess helps kids think ahead. (4) Before each move, players have to plan what might happen next.

(5) Chess also teaches patience. (6) A single game can last a long time, so players learn to wait and stay calm.

(7) Another good thing is that anyone can play. (8) It does not matter if you are tall or short, fast or slow. (9) Chess pieces include kings, queens, rooks and pawns.

(10) A chess club would give students a fun way to grow their minds, so our school should start one soon.$q$, 'draft')
