insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('0d052574-dedb-547c-a876-b0b7a7e3fe1b', 'wg3-opinion-writing-p08', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g3-opinion-writing'), null,
        '3-5', $q$Our School Needs a Talent Show$q$, $q$(1) Students at Cedar Lane School have many hidden talents. (2) Some can sing, some can juggle, and some can tell great jokes. (3) Our school should hold a talent show this year.

(4) A talent show would let students share what they are proud of. (5) For example, my older brother has practiced the violin for two years, but only our family has heard him play.

(6) A talent show could also help shy students feel brave. (7) Standing on a stage and hearing people clap can build confidence.

(8) The show could raise money too. (9) Families could pay one dollar for a ticket, and the money could buy new art supplies. (10) Last year, our school had a spelling bee in the gym.$q$, 'draft')
